{"id":"standpunkt","lemma":"Standpunkt","pos":"noun","rank":4040,"glosses":["standpoint","stance, point of view (attitude, opinion, or set of beliefs)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃtantpʊŋkt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/De-Standpunkt.ogg/De-Standpunkt.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Standpunktes","plural":"Standpunkte"},"examples":[{"text":"Du hast deinen Standpunkt deutlich gemacht.","en":"You've made your position clear.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"articulate, clear"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Ich stimme deinem Standpunkt nicht zu.","en":"I don't agree with your point of view.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"voice"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"}]},{"text":"Lass mich meinen Standpunkt erklären.","en":"Let me make my position clear.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to opine, to think"},null,{"g":"to explain"}]},{"text":"Sie haben Ihren Standpunkt deutlich gemacht.","en":"You've made your position clear.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"articulate, clear"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Es kommt alles auf den Standpunkt an.","en":"It all depends on your point of view.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"everything"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]}]}